d-b14c-02be4ae27bb5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9bb2244699ce3f8a543e1b5e7d7a0b9b, https://si.imgix.net/2a8e7ca4/uploads/origins/dd6f2696-8150-411d-b14c-02be4ae27bb5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2776e6803090424bcd0bcd3618df6724 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2a8e7ca4/uploads/origins/dd6f2696-8150-411d-b14c-02be4ae27bb5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6bd2b42e7a2e8a795da2aa532a9a17d4 3x"}, "body": "Hello! We really, really love Tsushin-sama's creations!  I would like to request a black-and-white comic of our own creative coupling, Tadashi and Kimiyuki in their school days (I have my partner's permission & he is also a fan of Tsushin-sama). \u2b07\ufe0f Characters' settings \u25a0Tadashi: A negative, sneaky, nerdy guy. He has a fetish for black hair. He hates \"yo-kas\" (cheerful people). He hates Kimiyuki the most among them. He is very nosy and bothers me. Too close! He scares me! Impossible! I thought he must be making fun of me...but then Kimiyuki started dating his twin sister and it was the worst. That's why yo-kas are like this! On the other hand, I really liked Kimiyuki when he had black hair and I used him as a wanker.  Kimiyuki is a cheerful and popular gal in the army. She sometimes has black hair and sometimes blonde hair. She's beautiful. She wants to get along with Mishima-kun (Tadashi). But he hates her and she is depressed. ...... She has no other choice but to satisfy her lust for Mishima by making a move on Tadashi's twin sister. He was found out and dumped, and Mishima hated him even more.  The setting of \u2b06\ufe0f is from the school days, and now Tadashi to Kimiyuki is a twisted obsession similar to faith, while Kimiyuki to Tadashi is a way of life and protection. The coupling is Tadashi x Kimiyuki, with Kimiyuki > Tadashi in height. They had a physical relationship once when they were students, but Tadashi (the aggressor) forced his way into it. Kimiyuki's hair color can be either black or blonde. If he has black hair, it will be the same as it is now, even when he was a student. I will leave the situation up to you. Thank you very much in advance! https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-KZkxBO51gm8FGZGT54gL9gzLXFhTp39", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@sanbaizoo333/works/69", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1999655, "client_id": 2548259, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/37479077/uploads/origins/43662d14-19e4-4b8b-8ddf-181db0ae351a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c36a11d6987d8e867cdabcd0920dc3e5", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/37479077/uploads/origins/43662d14-19e4-4b8b-8ddf-181db0ae351a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c36a11d6987d8e867cdabcd0920dc3e5, https://si.imgix.net/37479077/uploads/origins/43662d14-19e4-4b8b-8ddf-181db0ae351a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=96a6df6f1d83b0c1867a88739f84d46b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/37479077/uploads/origins/43662d14-19e4-4b8b-8ddf-181db0ae351a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=97fa791c7e24b6a30ddf40464b6d5293 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/37479077/uploads/origins/43662d14-19e4-4b8b-8ddf-181db0ae351a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1664826cd52252c0bedeb76b0eb48b5f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/37479077/uploads/origins/43662d14-19e4-4b8b-8ddf-181db0ae351a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1664826cd52252c0bedeb76b0eb48b5f, https://si.imgix.net/37479077/uploads/origins/43